  "releaseNotes": "Version 10.0.1 Release Notes:\n- Added thread-safe execution for all ThemeService operations using lock synchronization.\n- Added CurrentThemeKey and CurrentTheme properties to IThemeService.\n- Added ChangeThemeAsync method for non-blocking asynchronous theme switching.\n- Guaranteed UI updates on MainThread.\n- Fixed bug with initial theme key 0.\n- Fixed exception contracts (throws KeyNotFoundException when key is missing and InvalidOperationException if not initialized).\n- Fixed LINQ index increment side effects in auto key generation.",
